msgid "There are several web applications which can be used with Copter/Plane/Rover to allowing sharing flight data, videos or even allowing web based control. Below is the list of known applications (in alphabetical order)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:15
#: fc8cbe5f87ac405e99c04d7570a812b0
msgid "`dronetrack.org <http://www.dronetrack.org/>`__ - Real-Time tracking and sharing of flight paths"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:18
#: 7ffdb190fae34c918622c06bf7322dfc
msgid "`EXmaps.com <https://www.exmaps.com/>`__ - online flight logbook made for the ArduPilot system. Just drag and drop log files for post flight analysis and cumulative flight time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-web-apps.rst:22
#: c54969d899c74242a8ed2dbce7a68f04
msgid "`UAViators.org <http://uaviators.org/>`__ - video sharing site to aid humanitarian organizations and disaster affected communities with greater situation awareness."
msgstr ""

